  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **An Antidote for Strychnine**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Wishing the House Would Crash**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Letter From a Motel**: back after 262 archived shows (7525 days); rare: 4 archived performances; cut on the recording [2]\n- **Grendel's Mother**: back after 29 archived shows (507 days) [2]\n- **Going Invisible**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2019-09-04** (recommended): audience recording; 25 songs; 116 min [1]. Said about its sound: Microphones captured someone tapping along during the performance of this specific track; Izotope used for loudness and crowd noise reduction; backup recorded at -10db [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2019-09-04**: taped by tungol; transferred by roffels; source: AUD [1]",
